why: "球詠 on COMIC FUZ, cut to one chapter of each access state the platform has.\n\
  FOUR STATES AND NOT TWO, which is the mistake this adapter shipped: it read every\
  \ amount as paid\nand reported the platform 14% free when most of it can be read\
  \ for nothing a chapter a day.\n  2933  pointConsumption {}              free\n\
  \  47947 amount 30, NO badge              チャージ, one per series per day, free over\
  \ time\n  53783 amount 60, badge, type 1         先行, paid today and free from 2027/01/01\n\
  \  76444 amount 60, badge, type 2         a coin purchase with no end\n47947 is\
  \ the one that was wrong. It is deliberately unlabelled on the page, which is what\
  \ made it\nlook paid, and 2,067 of the 2,421 chapters held here are that state.\n\
  The publisher synopsis and every thumbnail are redacted: REQUIREMENTS §2 forbids\
  \ storing the first\nand the second is signed URLs that state no rule."
